#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:2
msgid "Multiple L1 Managers"
msgstr "多个 L1 管理器"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The MP server can serve KV objects from independently configured DRAM, "
"Device-DAX, and GDS L1 managers. Each manager has its own capacity, "
"eviction controller, and store controller. Each L2 adapter is bound to "
"one L1 chosen automatically from the managers' memory types."
msgstr ""
"MP 服务器可以从独立配置的 DRAM、Device-DAX 和 GDS L1 管理器中提供 KV "
"对象。每个管理器都有自己的容量、逐出控制器和存储控制器。L2 适配器使用固定的 L1 亲和性标签。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:10
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:12
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Repeat ``--l1-manager`` in write-placement order. Each JSON object "
"requires ``type``, a unique non-empty ``tag``, and ``size_gb`` (GiB). The"
" types are ``DRAM``, ``DEVDAX``, and ``GDS``. The ``_default`` tag is "
"reserved for DRAM in this interface."
msgstr ""
"重复 ``--l1-manager`` 以写入放置顺序。每个 JSON 对象需要 ``type``、一个唯一的非空 ``tag`` 和 "
"``size_gb``（GiB）。类型包括 ``DRAM``、``DEVDAX`` 和 ``GDS``。``_default`` "
"标签在此接口中保留给 DRAM，并且是 L2 适配器的默认亲和目标。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:17
msgid ""
"For example, use a dedicated Device-DAX device and a GDS-capable "
"directory:"
msgstr "例如，使用专用的 Device-DAX 设备和支持 GDS 的目录："

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For an end-to-end CXL / Device-DAX deployment walkthrough see :ref:`mp-"
"devdax-l1`. A Device-DAX L1 in this interface has no implicit DRAM pool. "
"Its size applies to the mapped device. Use dedicated, physically disjoint"
" regions: different Device-DAX paths can alias the same CXL memory. "
"Independent managers must not write those aliases concurrently. GDS uses "
"an ephemeral slab that is cleared at initialization; it does not restore "
"cached objects after a server restart."
msgstr ""
"在此接口中，Device-DAX L1 没有隐式的 DRAM 池。其大小适用于映射的设备。使用专用的、物理上不相交的区域：不同的 Device-"
"DAX 路径可以别名相同的 CXL 内存。独立的管理器不得同时写入这些别名。GDS "
"使用一个在初始化时清除的短暂内存块；它不会在服务器重启后恢复缓存对象。"

