#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Common optional JSON fields are ``align_bytes`` (4096), "
"``read_ttl_seconds`` (300), ``write_ttl_seconds`` (600), and "
"``eviction``. Alignment must be a positive power of two; GDS requires at "
"least 4096 bytes. TTLs must be positive integers. Unknown fields are "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"常见的可选 JSON 字段包括 ``align_bytes`` (4096)、``read_ttl_seconds`` "
"(300)、``write_ttl_seconds`` (600) 和 ``eviction``。对齐必须是正的二次幂；GDS 至少需要 4096"
" 字节。TTL 必须是正整数。未知字段将被拒绝。"

