msgid "Backend fields"
msgstr "后端字段"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:69
msgid ""
"``use_lazy`` (true), ``init_size_gb`` (20, capped at capacity), "
"``shm_name`` (empty), ``use_hugepages`` (false), ``mlock`` (false, see "
":doc:`configuration`). Shared memory and hugepages require eager "
"allocation. Shared-memory names must be unique."
msgstr ""
"``use_lazy`` (true), ``init_size_gb`` (20, 受容量限制), ``shm_name`` (空), "
"``use_hugepages`` (false), ``mlock`` (false, 见 "
":doc:`configuration`)。共享内存和大页需要提前分配。共享内存名称必须是唯一的。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:74
msgid ""
"Required ``path``; optional ``offset_gb`` (0), the offset into the device"
" where the mapping starts, so several servers can share one device with "
"disjoint ranges. The allocator checks that the range fits the device and "
"that the offset is page aligned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:79
msgid ""
"Required ``path``; ``backend`` (``auto``), ``direct_io`` (true). See "
":doc:`configuration` for backend requirements and location semantics."
msgstr ""
"必需的 ``path``；``backend`` (``auto``)，``direct_io`` (true)。有关后端要求和位置语义，请参见 "
":doc:`configuration`。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The global eviction flags supply defaults. Override them per manager "
"with, for example, "
"``\"eviction\":{\"eviction_policy\":\"LRU\",\"trigger_watermark\":0.9, "
"\"eviction_ratio\":0.1}``. Without global defaults each manager must "
"specify an eviction policy. ``noop`` is useful for controlled overflow "
"tests; an LRU manager may free space before a later write needs to "
"overflow."
msgstr ""
"全局逐出标志提供默认值。可以通过每个管理器覆盖它们，例如，``\"eviction\":{\"eviction_policy\":\"LRU\",\"trigger_watermark\":0.9,"
" \"eviction_ratio\":0.1}``。如果没有全局默认值，每个管理器必须指定一个逐出策略。``noop`` "
"对于受控溢出测试非常有用；LRU 管理器可能会在后续写入需要溢出之前释放空间。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:88
msgid ""
"Legacy single-L1 flags, including ``--l1-size-gb``, remain supported. Do "
"not combine ``--l1-manager`` with legacy capacity or backend-selection "
"flags. Python callers can use ``DRAML1ManagerConfig``, "
"``DevDaxL1ManagerConfig``, and ``GDSL1ManagerConfig``; their "
"``from_dict`` methods implement the JSON schema."
msgstr ""
"遗留的单层 L1 标志，包括 ``--l1-size-gb``，仍然受到支持。请勿将 ``--l1-manager`` "
"与遗留的容量或后端选择标志结合使用。Python 调用者可以使用 "
"``DRAML1ManagerConfig``、``DevDaxL1ManagerConfig`` 和 "
"``GDSL1ManagerConfig``；它们的 ``from_dict`` 方法实现了 JSON 架构。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:94
msgid "Placement, affinity, and reads"
msgstr "放置、亲和性和读取"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:96
msgid ""
"Writes try managers in argument order. Only ``OUT_OF_MEMORY`` results "
"move to the next manager; conflicts and exceptions do not. Allocation "
"remains atomic within each batch, so a batch can fail even when combined "
"free space across managers would suffice. This does not add cross-L1 "
"deduplication or migration."
msgstr ""
"写入尝试按照参数顺序管理。只有 ``OUT_OF_MEMORY`` "
"结果会移动到下一个管理器；冲突和异常不会。分配在每个批次内保持原子性，因此即使跨管理器的可用空间足够，批次仍然可能失败。这不会增加跨 L1 "
"的去重或迁移。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:101
msgid ""
"Each L2 adapter stores from and reloads into one L1, chosen at startup: "
"the first ``DRAM`` manager in argument order, or the first ``DEVDAX`` "
"manager when there is no ``DRAM`` manager. An adapter sees completed "
"stores from that manager only, so in the example above objects that "
"overflow into Device-DAX are not archived to ``fs``. A server whose only "
"L1 is ``GDS`` cannot use the existing L2 adapters and fails at startup. "
"Runtime adapter additions follow the same rule. The ``affinity_tag`` "
"field of earlier releases is rejected; each adapter's chosen L1 is logged"
" at startup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:110
msgid ""
"Lookups visit L1 managers synchronously. Prefetch selects one owner per "
"key and keeps that selection in the request's result. GPU completion "
"releases locks on those exact owners, including when another request "
"finds a different copy of the same key. Every manager has independent "
"read and write locks."
msgstr ""
"查找同步访问 L1 管理器。预取为每个键选择一个所有者，并将该选择保留在请求的结果中。GPU "
"完成时会释放对这些确切所有者的锁，包括当另一个请求找到同一键的不同副本时。每个管理器都有独立的读锁和写锁。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:116
msgid "Status and Prometheus"
msgstr "状态和 Prometheus"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:118
msgid "``GET /status`` includes these fields under ``storage_manager``:"
msgstr "``GET /status`` 包含这些字段在 ``storage_manager`` 下："

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:120
msgid ""
"``l1_managers``: status keyed by L1 tag, including object/lock counts, "
"staging bytes, used/allocated/configured memory, and capacity by medium."
msgstr "``l1_managers``：按 L1 标签键入的状态，包括对象/锁计数、暂存字节、已使用/分配/配置的内存以及按介质划分的容量。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:122
msgid ""
"``store_controllers`` and ``l1_eviction_controllers``: controller health "
"and progress keyed by tag."
msgstr "``store_controllers`` 和 ``l1_eviction_controllers``：按标签键控的控制器健康状况和进度。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:124
msgid ""
"``l1_usage``: aggregate ``[used_bytes, allocated_bytes]``. For lazy DRAM,"
" allocated bytes can be below configured capacity."
msgstr ""
"``l1_usage``: 聚合 ``[used_bytes, allocated_bytes]``。对于惰性 "
"DRAM，分配的字节数可能低于配置的容量。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:126
msgid ""
"``l1_capacity_bytes_by_backend``: configured/live capacity summed by "
"``dram``, ``devdax``, and ``gds``. Draining Device-DAX arenas are "
"excluded."
msgstr ""
"``l1_capacity_bytes_by_backend``: 按 ``dram``、``devdax`` 和 ``gds`` "
"汇总的配置/实时容量。排除了排空的 Device-DAX 区域。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:129
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The legacy singular status fields remain available when there is one "
"manager. ``GET /config`` includes every L1 configuration."
msgstr "当只有一个管理器时，遗留的单一状态字段仍然可用。``GET /config`` 包含每个 L1 配置和每个适配器的亲和性。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:132
msgid ""
"Prometheus exports ``lmcache_mp_l1_memory_usage_bytes``, "
"``lmcache_mp_l1_usage_ratio``, and ``lmcache_mp_l1_staging_bytes`` with "
"``l1_tag`` and ``backend`` labels. L1 read, write, and eviction counters "
"carry ``l1_tag`` alongside existing cache-salt labels. Optional lifecycle"
" histograms also use ``l1_tag`` and track each manager's copy "
"independently. Sum across ``l1_tag`` for server totals; do not sum usage "
"ratios. A legacy manager that combines DRAM and Device-DAX reports "
"``backend=\"dram+devdax\"`` for its combined usage."
msgstr ""
"Prometheus 导出 "
"``lmcache_mp_l1_memory_usage_bytes``、``lmcache_mp_l1_usage_ratio`` 和 "
"``lmcache_mp_l1_staging_bytes``，并带有 ``l1_tag`` 和 ``backend`` 标签。L1 "
"的读、写和逐出计数器携带 ``l1_tag`` 以及现有的缓存盐标签。可选的生命周期直方图也使用 "
"``l1_tag``，并独立跟踪每个管理器的副本。对 ``l1_tag`` 进行求和以获得服务器总数；不要对使用比例进行求和。一个将 DRAM 和"
" Device-DAX 结合的传统管理器报告 ``backend=\"dram+devdax\"`` 以表示其组合使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:141
msgid "Limits and serving validation"
msgstr "限制和服务验证"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:143
msgid ""
"Only **one GDS slab per process** is supported. The native GDS libraries "
"register CUDA streams process-wide; adding a second slab currently "
"conflicts with that registration. This limit permits every profile listed"
" above. A successful cuFile compatibility-mode transfer does not "
"establish native GPUDirect DMA support; check the deployment's driver and"
" filesystem."
msgstr ""
"仅支持 **每个进程一个 GDS 块**。本地 GDS 库在整个进程中注册 CUDA "
"流；当前添加第二个块会与该注册发生冲突。此限制允许上述列出的每个配置文件。成功的 cuFile 兼容模式传输并不建立本地 GPUDirect "
"DMA 支持；请检查部署的驱动程序和文件系统。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:149
msgid ""
"L1 topology is fixed at startup. The legacy single-region descriptor, "
"shared-memory transfer channel, P2P registration, and Device-DAX hotplug "
"API require a single compatible L1. Multi-L1 GPU serving uses the "
"existing LMCache-driven IPC transfer path. Hybrid models additionally "
"require their engine's supported recurrent-state connector and matching "
"block/chunk geometry; see :doc:`hybrid_models`."
msgstr ""
"L1 拓扑在启动时固定。传统的单区域描述符、共享内存传输通道、P2P 注册和设备 DAX 热插拔 API 需要一个兼容的单一 L1。多 L1 "
"GPU 服务使用现有的基于 LMCache 的 IPC 传输路径。混合模型还需要其引擎支持的递归状态连接器和匹配的块/块几何形状；请参见 "
":doc:`hybrid_models`。"

#: ../../source/mp/multi_l1.rst:156
msgid ""
"Storage profiles alone do not qualify an engine/model/TP combination. "
"Validate external-cache hits after clearing engine-local prefix state, "
"token outputs, per-tag writes and reads, and zero remaining locks. "
"Exercise every configured backend under pressure, and restart the engine "
"and server for a second run."
msgstr ""
"存储配置文件本身并不能使引擎/模型/TP "
"组合合格。在清除引擎本地前缀状态、令牌输出、每个标签的写入和读取以及零剩余锁后，验证外部缓存命中。在压力下对每个配置的后端进行测试，并重启引擎和服务器以进行第二次运行。"

